              "path": "webarena_data.md",
              "content": "# WebArena Performance Data Analysis\n\n## Raw Data Processing\n\n### All Data Points (31 entries as provided)\n```\n12/2025: 71.2\n10/2025: 68.0\n09/2025: 66.9\n10/2025: 64.2 (duplicate month)\n02/2025: 61.7\n01/2025: 58.1\n08/2024: 57.1\n12/2025: 54.6 (duplicate month)\n12/2024: 53.0\n01/2025: 52.1 (duplicate month)\n01/2025: 48.0 (duplicate month)\n10/2024: 45.7\n08/2024: 37.2 (duplicate month)\n10/2024: 35.8 (duplicate month)\n09/2024: 35.5\n04/2024: 33.5\n06/2025: 26.1\n04/2024: 23.5 (duplicate month)\n01/2025: 22.4 (duplicate month)\n04/2024: 20.2 (duplicate month)\n06/2024: 19.2\n04/2024: 18.2 (duplicate month)\n01/2025: 16.3 (duplicate month)\n06/2023: 14.9\n05/2024: 13.1\n06/2023: 11.7 (duplicate month)\n05/2024: 9.36 (duplicate month)\n03/2023: 8.87\n09/2023: 7.14\n12/2023: 7.12\n04/2024: 7.02 (duplicate month)\n10/2024: 6.28 (duplicate month)\n```\n\n## Chronologically Sorted Data (Earliest to Latest)\n\n| Date | Score | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| 03/2023 | 8.87 | Earliest data point |\n| 06/2023 | 14.9 | Best of 2 entries (11.7, 14.9) |\n| 09/2023 | 7.14 | |\n| 12/2023 | 7.12 | |\n| 04/2024 | 33.5 | Best of 5 entries (7.02, 18.2, 20.2, 23.5, 33.5) |\n| 05/2024 | 13.1 | Best of 2 entries (9.36, 13.1) |\n| 06/2024 | 19.2 | |\n| 08/2024 | 57.1 | Best of 2 entries (37.2, 57.1) |\n| 09/2024 | 35.5 | |\n| 10/2024 | 45.7 | Best of 3 entries (6.28, 35.8, 45.7) |\n| 12/2024 | 53.0 | |\n| 01/2025 | 58.1 | Best of 5 entries (16.3, 22.4, 48.0, 52.1, 58.1) |\n| 02/2025 | 61.7 | |\n| 06/2025 | 26.1 | |\n| 09/2025 | 66.9 | |\n| 10/2025 | 68.0 | Best of 2 entries (64.2, 68.0) |\n| 12/2025 | 71.2 | Best of 2 entries (54.6, 71.2) - Latest/highest |\n\n## Selected Representative Points (6 points for visualization)\n\nTo show the clear increasing trend without text overlap, selecting 6 evenly distributed points:\n\n1. **03/2023: 8.87** - Starting point, early benchmark\n2. **09/2023: 7.14** - Mid-2023 (shows initial low performance)\n3. **04/2024: 33.5** - Spring 2024 (first major jump)\n4. **08/2024: 57.1** - Summer 2024 (crossing 50% threshold)\n5. **01/2025: 58.1** - Early 2025 (sustained improvement)\n6. **12/2025: 71.2** - Latest point (peak performance)\n\n### Rationale\n- **Time span coverage**: March 2023 to December 2025 (33 months)\n- **Trend visibility**: Clear progression from ~9% to ~71%\n- **Even distribution**: Roughly 6-7 month intervals\n- **Key milestones**: Shows initial performance, major improvements, and peak\n- **No overlap**: 6 labels will fit comfortably on x-axis\n\n## Data Quality Notes\n\n- **Duplicate handling**: For months with multiple entries, selected the highest score (represents best performance achieved)\n- **Anomalies detected**: June 2025 shows 26.1, which is lower than earlier 2025 scores - likely a different test or model variant\n- **Overall trend**: Strong upward trajectory from ~9% (early 2023) to ~71% (late 2025)\n- **Growth rate**: ~8x improvement over 33 months\n",
