              "path": "webarena_data.md",
              "content": "# WebArena Performance Data Analysis\n\n## Raw Data Processing\n\n### All Data Points (31 entries as provided)\n```\n12/2025: 71.2\n10/2025: 68.0\n09/2025: 66.9\n10/2025: 64.2 (duplicate month)\n02/2025: 61.7\n01/2025: 58.1\n08/2024: 57.1\n12/2025: 54.6 (duplicate month)\n12/2024: 53.0\n01/2025: 52.1 (duplicate month)\n01/2025: 48.0 (duplicate month)\n10/2024: 45.7\n08/2024: 37.2 (duplicate month)\n10/2024: 35.8 (duplicate month)\n09/2024: 35.5\n04/2024: 33.5\n06/2025: 26.1\n04/2024: 23.5 (duplicate month)\n01/2025: 22.4 (duplicate month)\n04/2024: 20.2 (duplicate month)\n06/2024: 19.2\n04/2024: 18.2 (duplicate month)\n01/2025: 16.3 (duplicate month)\n06/2023: 14.9\n05/2024: 13.1\n06/2023: 11.7 (duplicate month)\n05/2024: 9.36 (duplicate month)\n03/2023: 8.87\n09/2023: 7.14\n12/2023: 7.12\n04/2024: 7.02 (duplicate month)\n10/2024: 6.28 (duplicate month)\n```\n\n## All Data Points Chronologically Sorted (31 total)\n\n| # | Date | Score | Notes |\n|---|------|-------|-------|\n| 1 | 03/2023 | 8.87 | Earliest data point |\n| 2 | 06/2023 | 11.7 | Different agent/method |\n| 3 | 06/2023 | 14.9 | Different agent/method |\n| 4 | 09/2023 | 7.14 | |\n| 5 | 12/2023 | 7.12 | |\n| 6 | 04/2024 | 7.02 | Different agent/method |\n| 7 | 04/2024 | 18.2 | Different agent/method |\n| 8 | 04/2024 | 20.2 | Different agent/method |\n| 9 | 04/2024 | 23.5 | Different agent/method |\n| 10 | 04/2024 | 33.5 | Different agent/method |\n| 11 | 05/2024 | 9.36 | Different agent/method |\n| 12 | 05/2024 | 13.1 | Different agent/method |\n| 13 | 06/2024 | 19.2 | |\n| 14 | 08/2024 | 37.2 | Different agent/method |\n| 15 | 08/2024 | 57.1 | Different agent/method |\n| 16 | 09/2024 | 35.5 | |\n| 17 | 10/2024 | 6.28 | Different agent/method |\n| 18 | 10/2024 | 35.8 | Different agent/method |\n| 19 | 10/2024 | 45.7 | Different agent/method |\n| 20 | 12/2024 | 53.0 | |\n| 21 | 01/2025 | 16.3 | Different agent/method |\n| 22 | 01/2025 | 22.4 | Different agent/method |\n| 23 | 01/2025 | 48.0 | Different agent/method |\n| 24 | 01/2025 | 52.1 | Different agent/method |\n| 25 | 01/2025 | 58.1 | Different agent/method |\n| 26 | 02/2025 | 61.7 | |\n| 27 | 06/2025 | 26.1 | |\n| 28 | 09/2025 | 66.9 | |\n| 29 | 10/2025 | 64.2 | Different agent/method |\n| 30 | 10/2025 | 68.0 | Different agent/method |\n| 31 | 12/2025 | 54.6 | Different agent/method |\n| 32 | 12/2025 | 71.2 | Latest/highest - different agent/method |\n\n## Selected Representative Points for X-Axis Labels (6 dates to avoid overlap)\n\nSince we're plotting all 31 points, we need to select only some dates for x-axis labels:\n\n1. **03/2023** - Starting point\n2. **06/2023** - Early 2023\n3. **04/2024** - Mid period\n4. **10/2024** - Late 2024\n5. **01/2025** - Early 2025\n6. **12/2025** - Latest point\n\n### Visualization Strategy\n- **Plot all 31 data points** as circles on the line\n- **Connect points in chronological order** showing the full progression\n- **Display only 6 date labels** on x-axis to prevent text overlap\n- **Show general upward trend** despite variation from different agents/methods\n\n## Data Quality Notes\n\n- **All duplicates preserved**: Multiple entries for same month represent different agents/methods tested\n- **Variation within months**: Shows diversity of approaches being tested on WebArena\n- **Overall trend**: Clear upward trajectory from ~7-9% (2023) to ~71% (late 2025)\n- **Growth pattern**: ~10x improvement over 33 months with significant acceleration in 2024\n",
