            {
              "path": "design_notes.md",
              "content": "# Mind2Web Dataset Visualization Design\n\n## Data Structure\n\n### Dataset Splits and Performance Values\n\n**Cross-Task Split:**\n- MindAct: 36.2\n- AWM-offline: 45.1\n- AWM-online: 43.6\n\n**Cross-Website Split:**\n- MindAct: 30.1\n- AWM-offline: 33.7\n- AWM-online: 33.9\n\n**Cross-Domain Split:**\n- MindAct: 26.4\n- AWM-offline: 32.6\n- AWM-online: 35.5\n\n### Data Observations\n1. **AWM superiority**: Both AWM methods consistently outperform MindAct baseline across all splits\n2. **Progressive trend**: AWM-online performance relative to AWM-offline improves as difficulty increases (cross-task → cross-website → cross-domain)\n   - Cross-task: offline (45.1) > online (43.6), difference = -1.5\n   - Cross-website: offline (33.7) < online (33.9), difference = +0.2\n   - Cross-domain: offline (32.6) < online (35.5), difference = +2.9\n\n## Visualization Strategy\n\n### Primary Insights to Communicate\n1. **Insight 1**: AWM methods (both offline and online) consistently outperform MindAct baseline\n2. **Insight 2**: AWM-online gradually outperforms AWM-offline as transfer difficulty increases\n\n### Chart Type\n**Grouped bar chart** with three groups (one per split), each containing three bars (one per method)\n\n### Layout Design\n\n**Ordering:**\n- X-axis groups: Cross-Task → Cross-Website → Cross-Domain (left to right, increasing difficulty)\n- Within each group: MindAct, AWM-offline, AWM-online (logical progression showing baseline then improvements)\n\n**Rationale**: This ordering naturally reveals the progressive trend where AWM-online catches up and surpasses AWM-offline\n\n### Color Scheme\n\nFollowing user preferences for semantic color coding:\n\n- **MindAct (baseline)**: Gray (#888888 or similar neutral gray)\n- **AWM-offline**: Medium green (#4CAF50 or #5CB85C)\n- **AWM-online**: Darker/richer green (#2E7D32 or #449944)\n\n**Rationale**:\n- Gray clearly distinguishes the baseline method\n- Two shades of green show both methods are \"ours\" while allowing distinction\n- Darker green for online helps it stand out when showing the crossover trend\n\n### Typography & Styling\n\nFollowing user preferences:\n- **Title**: 32px, bold\n- **Axis labels**: 20px\n- **Value labels**: 18px (displayed on or above bars)\n- **Bar width**: ~70px per bar\n- **Bar spacing**: Adequate grouping to show relationship within splits\n- **Minimal design**: Clean, no gridlines, simple axes\n\n### Visual Elements\n\n1. **Bars**: Grouped vertically showing performance values\n2. **Y-axis**: Performance metric (0-50 range suggested)\n3. **X-axis**: Three split categories clearly labeled\n4. **Value labels**: Display exact values on each bar for precision\n5. **Legend**: Simple, positioned top-right or top-center\n\n### Key Visual Cues\n\nTo emphasize Insight 2 (AWM-online overtaking AWM-offline):\n- Position bars so the green shades are adjacent for easy comparison\n- Consider subtle visual markers or slight emphasis on the crossover point\n- The natural height progression will visually communicate the trend\n\n## Implementation Notes\n\n- Use D3.js for flexibility and control\n- SVG-based rendering for crisp text at all sizes\n- Responsive design to ensure readability\n- Working directory: `/Users/zoraaa/Downloads/test-visual`\n- Output file: `mind2web_results.html`\n",
              "content_source": "filesystem",
              "error": null
            },
            {
              "path": "mind2web_results.html",
              "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Mind2Web Dataset Results</title>\n    <script src=\"https://d3js.org/d3.v7.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n        }\n\n        #chart-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .chart-title {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        .bar {\n            transition: opacity 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        .bar:hover {\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n\n        .axis text {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        .axis path,\n        .axis line {\n            stroke: #333;\n            stroke-width: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .value-label {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            fill: #333;\n        }\n\n        .legend {\n            font-size: 18px;\n        }\n\n        .legend-item {\n            cursor: default;\n        }\n\n        .legend-rect {\n            stroke: none;\n        }\n\n        .legend-text {\n            fill: #333;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"chart-container\">\n        <div class=\"chart-title\">Mind2Web Dataset Performance</div>\n        <svg id=\"chart\"></svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Data\n        const data = [\n            {\n                split: \"Cross-Task\",\n                methods: [\n                    { name: \"MindAct\", value: 36.2, type: \"baseline\" },\n                    { name: \"AWM-offline\", value: 45.1, type: \"awm\" },\n                    { name: \"AWM-online\", value: 43.6, type: \"awm-online\" }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                split: \"Cross-Website\",\n                methods: [\n                    { name: \"MindAct\", value: 30.1, type: \"baseline\" },\n                    { name: \"AWM-offline\", value: 33.7, type: \"awm\" },\n                    { name: \"AWM-online\", value: 33.9, type: \"awm-online\" }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                split: \"Cross-Domain\",\n                methods: [\n                    { name: \"MindAct\", value: 26.4, type: \"baseline\" },\n                    { name: \"AWM-offline\", value: 32.6, type: \"awm\" },\n                    { name: \"AWM-online\", value: 35.5, type: \"awm-online\" }\n                ]\n            }\n        ];\n\n        // Color scheme\n        const colors = {\n            \"baseline\": \"#888888\",     // Gray for baseline\n            \"awm\": \"#5CB85C\",          // Medium green for AWM-offline\n            \"awm-online\": \"#2E7D32\"    // Darker green for AWM-online\n        };\n\n        // Dimensions and margins\n        const margin = { top: 20, right: 150, bottom: 80, left: 60 };\n        const width = 1000 - margin.left - margin.right;\n        const height = 600 - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n        // Create SVG\n        const svg = d3.select(\"#chart\")\n            .attr(\"width\", width + margin.left + margin.right)\n            .attr(\"height\", height + margin.top + margin.bottom)\n            .append(\"g\")\n            .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n        // Scales\n        const x0 = d3.scaleBand()\n            .domain(data.map(d => d.split))\n            .range([0, width])\n            .padding(0.2);\n\n        const x1 = d3.scaleBand()\n            .domain(data[0].methods.map(d => d.name))\n            .range([0, x0.bandwidth()])\n            .padding(0.1);\n\n        const y = d3.scaleLinear()\n            .domain([0, 50])\n            .range([height, 0]);\n\n        // X-axis\n        svg.append(\"g\")\n            .attr(\"class\", \"axis\")\n            .attr(\"transform\", `translate(0,${height})`)\n            .call(d3.axisBottom(x0))\n            .selectAll(\"text\")\n            .style(\"font-size\", \"20px\")\n            .style(\"font-weight\", \"500\");\n\n        // Y-axis\n        svg.append(\"g\")\n            .attr(\"class\", \"axis\")\n            .call(d3.axisLeft(y).ticks(5))\n            .selectAll(\"text\")\n            .style(\"font-size\", \"20px\");\n\n        // Create groups for each split\n        const splitGroups = svg.selectAll(\".split-group\")\n            .data(data)\n            .enter()\n            .append(\"g\")\n            .attr(\"class\", \"split-group\")\n            .attr(\"transform\", d => `translate(${x0(d.split)},0)`);\n\n        // Create bars\n        splitGroups.selectAll(\".bar\")\n            .data(d => d.methods)\n            .enter()\n            .append(\"rect\")\n            .attr(\"class\", \"bar\")\n            .attr(\"x\", d => x1(d.name))\n            .attr(\"y\", d => y(d.value))\n            .attr(\"width\", x1.bandwidth())\n            .attr(\"height\", d => height - y(d.value))\n            .attr(\"fill\", d => colors[d.type]);\n\n        // Add value labels on bars\n        splitGroups.selectAll(\".value-label\")\n            .data(d => d.methods)\n            .enter()\n            .append(\"text\")\n            .attr(\"class\", \"value-label\")\n            .attr(\"x\", d => x1(d.name) + x1.bandwidth() / 2)\n            .attr(\"y\", d => y(d.value) - 8)\n            .attr(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\")\n            .text(d => d.value);\n\n        // Legend\n        const legend = svg.append(\"g\")\n            .attr(\"class\", \"legend\")\n            .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width - 120}, 20)`);\n\n        const legendData = [\n            { name: \"MindAct\", type: \"baseline\" },\n            { name: \"AWM-offline\", type: \"awm\" },\n            { name: \"AWM-online\", type: \"awm-online\" }\n        ];\n\n        const legendItems = legend.selectAll(\".legend-item\")\n            .data(legendData)\n            .enter()\n            .append(\"g\")\n            .attr(\"class\", \"legend-item\")\n            .attr(\"transform\", (d, i) => `translate(0, ${i * 30})`);\n\n        legendItems.append(\"rect\")\n            .attr(\"class\", \"legend-rect\")\n            .attr(\"width\", 20)\n            .attr(\"height\", 20)\n            .attr(\"fill\", d => colors[d.type]);\n\n        legendItems.append(\"text\")\n            .attr(\"class\", \"legend-text\")\n            .attr(\"x\", 28)\n            .attr(\"y\", 15)\n            .style(\"font-size\", \"18px\")\n            .text(d => d.name);\n\n        // Y-axis label\n        svg.append(\"text\")\n            .attr(\"transform\", \"rotate(-90)\")\n            .attr(\"y\", -45)\n            .attr(\"x\", -height / 2)\n            .attr(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\")\n            .style(\"font-size\", \"20px\")\n            .style(\"fill\", \"#333\")\n            .text(\"Performance\");\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
              "content_source": "filesystem",
              "error": null
            }
