            "about-me-slide-creation.md": "User researches AI agents that absorb human expertise through context rather than fine-tuning.\n\nUser focuses on expertise distillation across task distribution, procedural workflow, output verification, and automation granularity.\n\nUser advocates for human-centered coding agents that enhance rather than replace developer judgment.\n\nUser prefers writing with vivid metaphors, active verbs, concise prose, smooth transitions, and clear logic.\n\nUser tests AI frameworks through writing and visual design tasks in simulated benchmarks and real-world deployment.\n\nUser compares context-based adaptation versus traditional fine-tuning for capturing expert knowledge nuance.\n",
            "context-vs-weight-updates.md": "User prefers artistic, vivid writing style with concrete metaphors and dynamic verbs over plain academic prose.\n\nThe project studies expertise distillation into AI agents via context-based vs weight-based adaptation approaches.\n\nUser wants concise writing, particularly in results sections, avoiding redundant phrases.\n\nEvaluation uses writing and visual design tasks via both simulated benchmarks and in-the-wild deployment with human experts.\n\nThe framework elicits expertise across four dimensions: task distribution, procedural workflow, output verification, and automation granularity.\n\nUser values smooth flow between sentences with explicit transitions and clear logical connections.\n",
            "create-about-me-poster-in-landscape-layout.md": "User prefers concise writing with vivid metaphors and active verbs.\n\nUser researches AI agents that absorb human expertise through context rather than fine-tuning.\n\nUser advocates for human-centered coding agents that augment rather than replace developer judgment.\n\nUser's expertise framework covers task distribution, procedural workflow, output verification, and automation granularity.\n\nUser evaluates AI frameworks through writing and visual design tasks using both simulated benchmarks and real-world deployment.\n\nUser prefers orange color schemes for visual designs.\n",
            "creating-a-bar-chart-visualization.md": "User prefers orange color scheme for visualizations\n\nUser is working in directory /Users/zoraaa/Downloads/test-visual\n\nUser selected sample/demo data option for bar chart visualization\n\nUser expects immediate visual feedback in previews (SVG preferred over JavaScript rendering)\n\nUser values clean, professional chart styling with rounded corners and hover effects\n\nUser appreciates detailed confirmation messages listing implemented features\n",
            "human-centered-coding-agents-position-paper-abstract.md": "User prefers artistic writing style with active verbs and concrete metaphors rather than dry academic phrasing.\n\nUser is working on a position piece advocating for human-centered coding agents.\n\nUser strongly prefers concise writing.\n\nUser wants completely new content when existing materials are off-topic or irrelevant to the actual task.",
